":"WJ10127","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,74,70,68,80,67],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1030805","helmet":"WP1013002","shield":"WP10010"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,74,70,68,80,67],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1030805","helmet":"WP1013002","shield":"WP10010"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,74,70,68,80,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1030805","helmet":"WP1013002","shield":"WP10010"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,74,70,68,80,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1030805","helmet":"WP1013002","shield":"WP10010"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏名将李典之女，李祯之妹。李典少年好学厌武，故从军以来便将子女留在了兖州，由其妻子照料。虽然李典随曹操常年在外征战四方，但仍时而在路过兖州时看望妻儿，这也使得年少的李秋琴对兵事产生了兴趣，并在不久后练得一手好弓。后李典去世后，李秋琴之兄李祯继承李典职位，李秋琴亦随之前往洛阳。","tc":"曹魏名將李典之女，李禎之妹。李典少年好學厭武，故從軍以來便將子女留在了兗州，由其妻子照料。雖然李典隨曹操常年在外征戰四方，但仍時而在路過兗州時看望妻兒，這也使得年少的李秋琴對兵事產生了興趣，并在不久后練得一手好弓。后李典去世后，李秋琴之兄李禎繼承李典職位，李秋琴亦隨之前往洛陽。","en":"The daughter of Li Dian, a famed general of Cao Wei, and the younger sister of Li Zhen. Because Li Dian had loved learning and disliked warfare since boyhood, he left his children in Yan Province under his wife's care when he joined the military. Though Li Dian campaigned with Cao Cao across the land, he would visit his family whenever his travels took him through Yan Province. These visits sparked young Li Qiuqin's interest in military affairs, and before long she developed impressive skill with the bow. After Li Dian's death, her elder brother Li Zhen inherited Li Dian's post, and Li Qiuqin accompanied him to Luoyang.","jp":"曹魏の名将・李典の娘で、李禎の妹。李典は幼少より学問を好み武事を好まなかったため、従軍後は子女を兗州に残し、妻にその世話を任せていた。李典は曹操に従って長年各地を転戦していたが、兗州を通りかかる際には妻子のもとを訪ねていた。その影響で、幼い李秋琴は軍事に興味を抱くようになり、やがて優れた弓の腕前を身につけた。のちに李典が没すると、兄の李禎が李典の職を継ぎ、李秋琴も兄に伴って洛陽へと向かった。","kr":"조위의 명장 이전의 딸이자 이정의 여동생이다. 이전은 어린 시절 배움을 좋아하고 무예를 멀리하였기에, 종군한 이래 자녀들을 연주에 남겨 아내가 돌보게 하였다. 이전이 조조를 따라 오랜 세월 밖에서 사방으로 출정하면서도 연주를 지날 때면 종종 처자식을 찾아보곤 하였는데, 이로 인해 어린 이추금은 군사에 흥미를 품게 되었고 머지않아 뛰어난 궁술을 연마하였다. 훗날 이전이 세상을 떠나자 이추금의 오라비인 이정이 아버지의 직위를 계승하였고, 이추금 역시 오라비를 따라 낙양으로 향하였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ11037","remark":"","surname":"李","surnameTc":"李","surnameEn":"Li","surnameJp":"李","surnameKr":"이","surnameOther":"","name":"秋琴","nameTc":"秋琴","nameEn":"Qiuqin","nameJp":"秋琴","nameKr":"추금","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"李秋琴","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"210","city":"CS1026","gender":"1","rule":"70","force":"74","wise":"70","politics":"68","charm":"80","will":"67","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"9","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"10","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"36/36/82/36/36/29/50/36","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4900","battleSoulPoint":"5200","debateSoulPoint":"4900","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"2/0/0/3/0/0/3/0/1/0/1/1/1/4/1/5/2/3/2/1/1/2/4/1","attrib